{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"anyOf":[{"required":["extends"]},{"required":["facts","goals","actions"]}],"description":"What an NPC knows, wants and can do, for goal-oriented action planning: facts with their starting values, goals by priority and actions with what they need, what they change and what they cost. The npc system plans the cheapest chain of actions to the first goal it can reach. A brain can extend a shared one, adding and changing its facts, traits, goals, actions and routes by name.","properties":{"actions":{"description":"What the NPC can do, in the order ties are broken.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"cost":{"default":1.0,"description":"What it costs; plans take the cheapest chain.","exclusiveMinimum":0.0,"type":"number"},"do":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"What the action does while it runs, at most one of wait, go_to, follow_route and emit; with none it ends at once. Its effects apply when it ends.","maxProperties":2,"properties":{"emit":{"description":"A world event to emit, about the agent, with the action's name; gameplay code answers it by setting facts.","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"follow_route":{"description":"A route of the brain's routes to walk, from its first point (or where the agent left it) to its last, then back to the first if it is closed.","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"go_to":{"description":"The ID of the entity to walk to, along the agent's NavigationAgent3D or 2D path when it has one.","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"speed":{"default":0.0,"description":"How fast a go_to or follow_route walks; 0 is the agent's speed.","minimum":0.0,"type":"number"},"wait":{"default":0.0,"description":"Seconds it takes.","minimum":0.0,"type":"number"}},"type":"object"},"effects":{"additionalProperties":{"type":["boolean","integer","string"]},"description":"What it changes when it ends: facts by name, each a value to set (true, false or a whole number) or a change such as \"+1\" or \"-2\".","type":"object"},"name":{"description":"The action's name.","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"needs":{"additionalProperties":{"anyOf":[{"type":["boolean","integer","string"]},{"items":{"type":["boolean","integer","string"]},"minItems":1,"type":"array"}]},"description":"What must hold before it runs: Facts by name, each a value it must equal (true, false or a whole number), a string comparing it (\"!=0\", \"<5\", \"<=5\", \">0\" or \">=1\") or a list of them that must all hold, such as [\">=8\", \"<20\"].","type":"object"},"remove":{"description":"In a brain that extends another: drops the action of this name.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["name"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"extends":{"description":"A shared .npc.json brain this one builds on: its facts, traits, routes, goals and actions come first, and this file's replace them by name (a goal or action's fields one by one; \"remove\": true drops one) or add to them.","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"facts":{"additionalProperties":{"type":["boolean","integer"]},"description":"Every fact by name, with its starting value: true, false (1 and 0) or a whole number. Facts named hour and day follow the npc clock, and facts named story.<name> are the story's facts (the QuestLog's), which actions' effects write back.","type":"object"},"format":{"const":1,"description":"The file format's version."},"goals":{"description":"What the NPC wants, tried highest priority first.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"name":{"description":"The goal's name.","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"priority":{"default":0.0,"description":"Higher goals are tried first; equal ones in the file's order.","minimum":-1000000000.0,"type":"number"},"remove":{"description":"In a brain that extends another: drops the goal of this name.","type":"boolean"},"want":{"additionalProperties":{"anyOf":[{"type":["boolean","integer","string"]},{"items":{"type":["boolean","integer","string"]},"minItems":1,"type":"array"}]},"description":"What the goal wants (required): Facts by name, each a value it must equal (true, false or a whole number), a string comparing it (\"!=0\", \"<5\", \"<=5\", \">0\" or \">=1\") or a list of them that must all hold, such as [\">=8\", \"<20\"].","type":"object"},"when":{"additionalProperties":{"anyOf":[{"type":["boolean","integer","string"]},{"items":{"type":["boolean","integer","string"]},"minItems":1,"type":"array"}]},"description":"When the goal applies: Facts by name, each a value it must equal (true, false or a whole number), a string comparing it (\"!=0\", \"<5\", \"<=5\", \">0\" or \">=1\") or a list of them that must all hold, such as [\">=8\", \"<20\"].","type":"object"}},"required":["name"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"routes":{"additionalProperties":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"closed":{"default":false,"description":"Whether it goes back to its first point at the end, as a patrol's loop.","type":"boolean"},"points":{"description":"Where the route goes, in order.","items":{"anyOf":[{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"items":{"type":"number"},"maxItems":3,"minItems":2,"type":"array"}],"description":"An entity's ID, or a place: [x, y] in 2D, [x, y, z] in 3D."},"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["points"],"type":"object"},"description":"Paths the NPC walks by name, for follow_route actions: patrols and daily rounds.","type":"object"},"search_limit":{"default":2048,"description":"The most states a plan may look at before the goal counts as out of reach.","maximum":1000000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"traits":{"additionalProperties":{"type":["boolean","integer"]},"description":"What this NPC is like, by name (bravery, greed), as facts that conditions read and no action changes: true, false or a whole number.","type":"object"}},"required":["format"],"title":"SlashEngine NPC brain (.npc.json)","type":"object"}
